WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.460
A field drawn as a grid.

2
00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:05.490
A young woman in white
stands on one square.

3
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.620
Huge shadowy hands slide
her from square to square.

4
00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:10.690
Family.

5
00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:11.560
Money.

6
00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:12.500
Men.

7
00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:13.640
The law.

8
00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:17.030
A man sneers, "That's
what every woman says."

9
00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:20.830
She turns on him: "How can
you dare to use such words!"

10
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:23.700
The hands pause, and she stands still.

11
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:28.120
So does Tess act, or
is she only acted upon?

12
00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:31.500
In this mission, you'll meet a
girl caught between two worlds,

13
00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:33.940
who "spoke two languages".

14
00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:37.220
You'll weigh what she does:
refusing a man's money,

15
00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.060
baptising her own baby,
confessing on her wedding night.

16
00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:44.680
And you'll decide where each
choice belongs on that line.

17
00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:49.320
Your mission: decide whether
Tess acts, or is only acted upon.
